{'symbol': 'ICE', 'date': '2022-10-18 08:45:00', 'title': 'ICE EXPANDS EQUITY DERIVATIVES COMPLEX WITH THE LAUNCH OF FTSE® 100 INDEX TOTAL RETURN FUTURE', 'text': 'LONDON--(BUSINESS WIRE)--INTERCONTINENTAL EXCHANGE, INC. (NYSE: ICE), A LEADING GLOBAL PROVIDER OF DATA, TECHNOLOGY, AND MARKET INFRASTRUCTURE, AND HOME TO THE MOST LIQUID MARKETS FOR TRADING FTSE® DERIVATIVES, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT PLANS TO LAUNCH A FTSE® 100 INDEX TOTAL RETURN FUTURE (TRF) ON NOVEMBER 14, 2022, SUBJECT TO REGULATORY APPROVAL.'}